<agent>all</agent>
<description>OS Security Patch Assessment is not available on the remote host.
This does not necessarily indicate a problem with the scan.
Credentials may not have been provided, OS security patch assessment may not be supported for the target, the target may not have been identified, or another issue may have occurred that prevented OS security patch assessment from being available. See plugin output for details.

This plugin reports non-failure information impacting the availability of OS Security Patch Assessment. Failure information is reported by plugin 21745 : &apos;OS Security Patch Assessment failed&apos;.  If a target host is not supported for OS Security Patch Assessment, plugin 110695 : &apos;OS Security Patch Assessment Checks Not Supported&apos; will report concurrently with this plugin.</description>
